WEBVTT

00:00:00.905 --> 00:00:03.366
DUMBLEDORE: Well, now we're all
settled in and sorted...

00:00:03.574 --> 00:00:05.910
...I'd like to make an announcement.

00:00:06.911 --> 00:00:10.206
This castle will not only be
your home this year...

00:00:10.373 --> 00:00:13.584
...but home to some
very special guests as well.

00:00:13.918 --> 00:00:16.462
You see, Hogwarts has been chosen....

00:00:17.463 --> 00:00:18.923
Yes, what is it?

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.591
What is it?

00:00:22.927 --> 00:00:26.222
Tell them to wait.
Tell them to wait. Wait.

00:00:26.389 --> 00:00:32.395
So Hogwarts has been chosen
to host a legendary event:

00:00:32.603 --> 00:00:34.605
The Triwizard Tournament.

00:00:34.939 --> 00:00:37.108
-For those of you who do not know...
BOTH: Brilliant.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.611
...the Triwizard Tournament
brings together three schools...

00:00:40.778 --> 00:00:42.822
...for a series of magical contests.

00:00:42.947 --> 00:00:46.492
From each school, a single student
is selected to compete.

00:00:46.784 --> 00:00:48.411
Now let me be clear.

00:00:48.619 --> 00:00:51.497
If chosen, you stand alone.

00:00:51.789 --> 00:00:53.624
And trust me when I say...

00:00:53.916 --> 00:00:56.919
...these contests are not
for the faint-hearted.

00:00:56.961 --> 00:01:01.424
But more of that later.
For now, please join me in welcoming...

00:01:01.632 --> 00:01:03.968
...the lovely ladies of the
Beauxbatons Academy of Magic...

00:01:05.803 --> 00:01:09.807
...and their headmistress,
Madame Maxime.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.946
RON:
Bloody hell.

00:01:31.829 --> 00:01:33.998
Blimey. That's one big woman.

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:58.064
And now our friends from the north.

00:01:58.356 --> 00:02:01.067
Please greet the proud sons
of Durmstrang...

00:02:01.359 --> 00:02:04.028
...and their high master,
Igor Karkaroff.

00:02:27.093 --> 00:02:28.886
STUDENT:
Oh, it's Krum!

00:02:29.053 --> 00:02:30.388
Blimey, it's him!

00:02:30.596 --> 00:02:32.431
Viktor Krum!

00:02:41.399 --> 00:02:42.900
KARKAROFF:
Albus.

00:02:43.067 --> 00:02:44.735
Igor.

00:02:58.249 --> 00:03:01.961
Professor Dumbly-dorr,
my horses have traveled a long way.

00:03:02.086 --> 00:03:04.755
-They will need attending to.
-Don't worry, Madame Maxime.

00:03:04.922 --> 00:03:08.384
Our gamekeeper, Hagrid,
is more than capable of seeing to them.

00:03:08.551 --> 00:03:10.928
MAXIME:
But you know, Monsieur Hagrid...

00:03:11.262 --> 00:03:13.639
...they drink only single-malt whiskey.

00:03:15.057 --> 00:03:16.267
Ah!

00:03:20.062 --> 00:03:21.564
You idiot!

00:03:26.485 --> 00:03:28.487
DUMBLEDORE:
Your attention, please!

00:03:30.656 --> 00:03:32.700
I'd like to say a few words.

00:03:34.869 --> 00:03:36.871
Eternal glory.

00:03:37.246 --> 00:03:41.250
That is what awaits the student
who wins the Triwizard Tournament.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:45.755
But to do this, that student
must survive three tasks.

00:03:46.005 --> 00:03:49.842
Three extremely dangerous tasks.

00:03:50.217 --> 00:03:52.637
BOTH: Wicked.
DUMBLEDORE: For this reason...

00:03:52.887 --> 00:03:55.723
...the Ministry has seen fit
to impose a new rule.

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:57.141
To explain all this...

00:03:57.391 --> 00:04:01.020
...we have the head of the Department
of International Magical Cooperation...

00:04:01.103 --> 00:04:03.272
...Mr. Bartemius Crouch.

00:04:17.787 --> 00:04:20.414
RON:
Bloody hell. It's Mad-Eye Moody.

00:04:21.165 --> 00:04:24.418
-Alastor Moody? The Auror?
-Auror?

00:04:24.669 --> 00:04:28.089
Dark-wizard catcher. Half the cells
in Azkaban are filled thanks to him.

00:04:28.881 --> 00:04:32.051
He's supposed to be mad as a hatter,
though, these days.

00:04:43.688 --> 00:04:47.400
-My dear old friend, thanks for coming.
-Stupid ceiling.

00:04:47.566 --> 00:04:48.776
Thank you.

00:04:55.157 --> 00:04:57.118
What's that he's drinking,
do you suppose?

00:04:57.535 --> 00:05:00.538
I don't know, but I don't think
it's pumpkin juice.

00:05:07.461 --> 00:05:09.422
CROUCH:
After due consideration...

00:05:09.588 --> 00:05:12.466
...the Ministry has concluded that,
for their own safety...

00:05:12.717 --> 00:05:15.594
...no student under the age of 17...

00:05:15.845 --> 00:05:19.557
...shall be allowed to put forth their
name for the Triwizard Tournament.

00:05:19.724 --> 00:05:22.351
-This decision is final.
FRED: That's rubbish!

00:05:22.601 --> 00:05:25.146
That's rubbish!
You don't know what you're doing!

00:05:25.312 --> 00:05:29.150
-Silence!
-They're not too happy about that, then.
